&lt;div id="overview" class="anchor">&lt;/div>
&lt;span
class="absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 ltr:-left-6 rtl:-right-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100">
&lt;a class="group-hover:text-primary-300 dark:group-hover:text-neutral-700 !no-underline" href="#overview" aria-label="Anchor">#&lt;/a>
&lt;/span>
&lt;/h2>
&lt;p>Every day, you move. Cycling, typing on a keyboard, playing an instrument &amp;ndash; all of it is controlled by a finely-tuned process that your brain, nerves, and muscles follow in order to translate your intentions into accurate, fine movements. This multi-system process doesn&amp;rsquo;t always go perfectly, however: Maybe you have experienced shaky hands or legs after a workout, or an annoying bout of hiccups.&lt;/p></description><media:content xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" url="https://prisma.groningen/projects/movement_disorders/featuredleap.webp"/></item><item><title>Galaxy identification through radiotelescopy</title><link>https://prisma.groningen/projects/radiotelescope/</link><pubDate>Tue, 10 Jun 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>youremail@example.com (Your name here)</author><guid>https://prisma.groningen/projects/radiotelescope/</guid><description>&lt;p>We are migrating content to this page, stay tuned!&lt;/p></description><media:content xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" url="https://prisma.groningen/projects/radiotelescope/featuredradiotelescope.jpg"/></item><item><title>Inhibition is what you also need</title><link>https://prisma.groningen/projects/inhibition/</link><pubDate>Tue, 10 Jun 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>youremail@example.com (Your name here)</author><guid>https://prisma.groningen/projects/inhibition/</guid><description>&lt;p>We are migrating content to this page, stay tuned!&lt;/p></description><media:content xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" url="https://prisma.groningen/projects/inhibition/featuredtransformer.png"/></item><item><title>Security using sensor noise identification</title><link>https://prisma.groningen/projects/security/</link><pubDate>Tue, 10 Jun 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>youremail@example.com (Your name here)</author><guid>https://prisma.groningen/projects/security/</guid><description>&lt;p>We are migrating content to this page, stay tuned!&lt;/p></description><m